1
00:00:00,633 --> 00:00:02,363
(Howard:)He abandoned me and my mother.

2
00:00:02,535 --> 00:00:07,305
(Howard:)Why does he deserve a chance
to explain anything?

3
00:00:07,474 --> 00:00:09,134
(Bernadette:)I get that.

4
00:00:10,009 --> 00:00:11,709
So, what do you wanna do with it?

5
00:00:13,313 --> 00:00:15,903
Something I should've done
a long time ago.

6
00:00:18,017 --> 00:00:19,747
(Bernadette:)Really? Are you sure?

7
00:00:19,919 --> 00:00:21,389
(Howard:)Yep.

8
00:00:29,329 --> 00:00:30,419
(Bernadette:)Feel better?

9
00:00:30,630 --> 00:00:32,150
(Howard:)I do.

10
00:00:36,035 --> 00:00:37,265
(Howard:)Great.

11
00:00:37,437 --> 00:00:40,567
(Howard:)Neither one of us
is tall enough to reach that.

12
00:00:47,046 --> 00:00:49,036
(Amy:)I can't believe he set it on fire.

13
00:00:49,215 --> 00:00:51,915
(Bernadette:)Yeah, just seeing that letter
really freaked him out.

14
00:00:52,085 --> 00:01:01,025
(Bernadette:)And he was already having a tough day.
He accidentally wore my pants to work.

